    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-summary-0000002022225249#section19331230181011",
      "text": "华为游戏服务器调用此接口查询玩家在玩游戏的概要数据，并将信息展示在游戏中心的“在玩”页面上。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-summary-0000002022225249#section133671740131017",
      "text": "Header参数"
    },
    {
